          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "INLETS\n\n• Input\nThe value that you want to hold goes here.\n\n• Arm\nThis can be a trigger or an event change to arm the Hold node and store the incomming value.\n\n• Release.\nThis can be a trigger or an event change to release the value currently stored by the Hold node\n"
